    },
    "body": "Deprecated in v32 (https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35605), this deletes the useless and harmful `removeprunedfunds` RPC. \r\n\r\nIt also removes deleting of watchonly transactions from the not-watchonly migrated wallet, which in theory we should clean up, but in practice this does nothing for the user, the only observable change is that if the user knows the txid they can do `gettransaction` and the migrated wallet will return the transaction information even though it does not have keys for the transaction, AFAICT for both GUI and RPC having irrelevant transactions inside of wallet is harmless and does not affect the output of anything, since most stuff is gated behind `IsMine()` anyways.\r\n\r\nRemoving both the RPC and the deletion of watchonly tx'es allows deleting the logic for transaction removal and the associated tests. \r\n\r\n_LLM Disclosure: Not used to write this PR or PR description, but I recently replaced clang on my machine with gemma-4-26B directly generating machine code._",
